{"id":28177,"author":"VerdammtNils","body":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eAge: 17\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eTimezone:\r\nBerlin (Germany)\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have\r\nTeamspeak?\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eYes\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have\r\nDiscord? No but I can Install it\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have\r\naccess to a recording software?\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eYes, obs\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eCRITERIA 1:\r\nSELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have\r\nany experience as a moderator on other servers?\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eYeah I\r\nwas mod for a month at the Hive.Mc. \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI had an\r\nown Server with 250 Members and also Staff and I Know what I Should do as a\r\nstaff.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat is\r\nyour biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eExplaining\r\nis weak because I’m from Germany but I think in my Age now its easier and I\r\nalso visit America so I can speak English now better than 2 years ago. \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat\r\nqualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a\r\nleader? Why/why not?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eA leader\r\nmust be able to speak to others and must explain questions when they have a\r\nquestion. A leader must also know what he's doing in bad situations. Yes I’m\r\nable to answer questions from members and also know what I do in bad\r\nsituations. He must be helpful. And always be friendly\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat\r\nattributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you to be a\r\nmoderator? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI’m\r\nalways polite and I’m helping other members even though I’m not a Mod. And I’m\r\nalways polite to other Staff members and talk with them on TeamSpeak. I know\r\nwhat to do when other players have questions or have a problem on the Avicus\r\nwebsite or in the game.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat skills\r\ndo you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you\r\nbelieve you have these skills? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eIf a member need help I should help him.\r\nAnd always friendly. And talk with the community. Yes sure I have these skills.\r\n\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat in\r\nyour opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when\r\nmoderating?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e- Be\r\nalways polite\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e-Can\r\nanswer questions to help other Members\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e-Can\r\nwork in a Team with other staff’s and talk with players if the have a problem\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eCRITERIA 2:\r\nGENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou notice\r\na moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have\r\ninsufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You\r\nnotice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do\u003cu\u003e? \u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eI would tell it to other staff members and ask\r\nthem what they mean to it. But I’ll point it out politly for sure. But I don’t\r\ndo anything alone without the opinions of others.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou are in\r\nTeamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully\r\nabout a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an\r\nextent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful\r\nsoon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What\r\nwould you do? \u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI would\r\ntell them that they should refrain from talking about employees to. And I’m\r\ntrying to change the subject.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou are in\r\nan Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day\r\nin your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a\r\nthread that only staff members can see. The content in the screenshot isn’t\r\nvery important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums.\r\nIf anything, what would you do\u003cu\u003e? \u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eI would read\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\r\n\u003c/span\u003eit because it might be\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eimportant.\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eAnd when I have a question to the sreenshot I\r\nask him whether it was important for the website.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eSome senior\r\nstaff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing\r\nothers ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They\r\ndon’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they\r\nare using their permissions the way they are. What would you do? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003ewould say that they should calm down and say\r\nthat they shouldn’t take it seriously. Because it’s only fun and would explain\r\nto them the situation.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eCRITERIA 3:\r\nOTHER\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eNOTE: This\r\nis a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer\r\nand more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There\r\nis no right or wrong answer.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhy do you\r\nwant to be a moderator?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eBecause I can support the English and\r\nGerman Member’s if they have any questions. And i have experience in this job\r\nbecause I was on 2 other Servers a Mod and know what to do.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat does\r\nAvicus mean to you?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eAvicus is a friendly server and I love the\r\nhandling with each other.\u003c/u\u003e \u003cu\u003eAnd Avicus was my first PvP Server and I’m\r\nstill excited about this Server because the server I well structured.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eAnything\r\nspecific the staff team could do better?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eNo they are doing a great job! And they\r\nknow what they are doing.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhy did you\r\nchoose to apply at Avicus? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eBecause\r\nI Play now I think 2 years on this server and after half a year I buy me\r\nEmerald. Now I Wan’t to Support the Server . And I know how the server is set\r\nup.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have\r\nanything else to add to your application?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI think\r\nthis was all what I wanted to say. I hope I write few more Details they have\r\nmissed.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eI would be happy about a Response.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWith\r\nfriendly greetings\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eVerdammtNils\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003c/font\u003e","body_tagged":"\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eAge: 17\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eTimezone:\r\nBerlin (Germany)\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have\r\nTeamspeak?\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eYes\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have\r\nDiscord? No but I can Install it\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have\r\naccess to a recording software?\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eYes, obs\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eCRITERIA 1:\r\nSELF REFLECTION/EVALUATION \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eDo you have\r\nany experience as a moderator on other servers?\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\r\n\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eYeah I\r\nwas mod for a month at the Hive.Mc. \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI had an\r\nown Server with 250 Members and also Staff and I Know what I Should do as a\r\nstaff.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat is\r\nyour biggest weakness and how will it affect your moderating? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eExplaining\r\nis weak because I’m from Germany but I think in my Age now its easier and I\r\nalso visit America so I can speak English now better than 2 years ago. \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat\r\nqualities do you think a leader must have? Would you consider yourself a\r\nleader? Why/why not?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eA leader\r\nmust be able to speak to others and must explain questions when they have a\r\nquestion. A leader must also know what he's doing in bad situations. Yes I’m\r\nable to answer questions from members and also know what I do in bad\r\nsituations. He must be helpful. And always be friendly\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat\r\nattributes distinguish yourself from other players that qualify you to be a\r\nmoderator? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI’m\r\nalways polite and I’m helping other members even though I’m not a Mod. And I’m\r\nalways polite to other Staff members and talk with them on TeamSpeak. I know\r\nwhat to do when other players have questions or have a problem on the Avicus\r\nwebsite or in the game.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat skills\r\ndo you believe you should have when interacting with the community? Do you\r\nbelieve you have these skills? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eIf a member need help I should help him.\r\nAnd always friendly. And talk with the community. Yes sure I have these skills.\r\n\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat in\r\nyour opinion are the three main character traits a moderator must have when\r\nmoderating?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e- Be\r\nalways polite\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e-Can\r\nanswer questions to help other Members\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e-Can\r\nwork in a Team with other staff’s and talk with players if the have a problem\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eCRITERIA 2:\r\nGENERAL SITUATIONS\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou notice\r\na moderator giving out a lot of false bans. They almost always have\r\ninsufficient evidence or sometimes no evidence and they don’t seem to care. You\r\nnotice it but other staff members don’t. What would you do\u003cu\u003e? \u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003eI would tell it to other staff members and ask\r\nthem what they mean to it. But I’ll point it out politly for sure. But I don’t\r\ndo anything alone without the opinions of others.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou are in\r\nTeamspeak with a few other players and they begin talking quite disrespectfully\r\nabout a particular staff member. You agree with what they’re saying to an\r\nextent, but the conversation starts to become racial and very disrespectful\r\nsoon after. You are all in a nightclub channel where this is allowed. What\r\nwould you do? \u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI would\r\ntell them that they should refrain from talking about employees to. And I’m\r\ntrying to change the subject.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003eYou are in\r\nan Avicus team. One of your teammates is also an Avicus Staff member. One day\r\nin your team discord the team member/staff member posts a screenshot of a\r\nthread that only staff members can see. The content in the screenshot isn’t\r\nvery important/confidential but only staff members could see it on the forums.\r\nIf anything, what would you do\u003cu\u003e? \u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eI would read\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\r\n\u003c/span\u003eit because it might be\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eimportant.\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003eAnd when I have a question to the sreenshot I\r\nask him whether it was important for the website.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eSome senior\r\nstaff members are in teamspeak joking around with each other. They are removing\r\nothers ranks, creating certain channels and even harassing certain users. They\r\ndon’t mean any harm but some players in the channel feel a bit angry that they\r\nare using their permissions the way they are. What would you do? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eI\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp; \u003c/span\u003ewould say that they should calm down and say\r\nthat they shouldn’t take it seriously. Because it’s only fun and would explain\r\nto them the situation.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eCRITERIA 3:\r\nOTHER\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eNOTE: This\r\nis a new criteria and these questions are less to do with right/wrong answer\r\nand more to do with us getting to know you. Please answer these honestly. There\r\nis no right or wrong answer.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhy do you\r\nwant to be a moderator?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eBecause I can support the English and\r\nGerman Member’s if they have any questions. And i have experience in this job\r\nbecause I was on 2 other Servers a Mod and know what to do.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhat does\r\nAvicus mean to you?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eAvicus is a friendly server and I love the\r\nhandling with each other.\u003c/u\u003e \u003cu\u003eAnd Avicus was my first PvP Server and I’m\r\nstill excited about this Server because the server I well structured.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eAnything\r\nspecific the staff team could do better?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont face=\"Calibri\"\u003e\u003cfont size=\"3\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/span\u003e\u003cu\u003eNo they are doing a great job! And they\r\nknow what they are doing.\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eWhy did you\r\nchoose to apply at Avicus? \u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cu\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eBecause\r\nI Play now I think 2 years on this server and after half a year I buy me\r\nEmerald. Now I Wan’t to Support the Server . And I know how the server is set\r\nup.\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/u\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 13px;\"\u003e\u003cspan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px;\"\u003e\u003cfont color=\"#000000\" face=\"Calibri\" size=\"3\"\u003eDo you have\r\nanything else to add to your application?\u003c/font\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\r\n\r\n\u003cp style=\"margin: 0px 0px 